:20: error [deem q]: deem: parameter `t: &WAny` binds an ERASED Writ value as a query source: a deem relation's columns are typed at COMPILE time (every column type must implement `Hash`/`Eq`; the static tier has no `dyn` column), so an erased element has no column vocabulary and CEL-style Null propagation has nowhere to attach. Lenient binding (`QEnv::bind_source_erased` / `bind_node_erased`, ADR 0012-queue2 §4a) was an INTERPRETER-only surface and is withdrawn with the interpreter
